        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Small Editable Surface",
          "text": "autoresearch 仅允许优化 prototype/design 的 prompt policy、rule policy、design brief extractor、guideline mapping、review thresholds",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Design Brief Artifact",
          "text": "`prototype plan` 之前必须产出 `design-brief.json`，包含 audience、tone、visual direction、typography intent、color intent、motion intent、differentiator",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002A",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Description-as-Design Mode",
          "text": "design brief 必须显式包含 `design_generation_mode=description-as-design` 或等价字段，并可声明 interactive prototype required",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Frontend-design Contract",
          "text": "`frontend-design` 输出被规范化为 `design-system-contract.json` 或等价 artifact，供 prototype renderer 消费",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Distinct Aesthetic Guard",
          "text": "design contract 必须能表达并约束“禁止 generic AI aesthetic”，至少覆盖字体、配色、布局/空间、动效策略",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004A",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Unified Directory Page",
          "text": "`prototype` 必须提供统一目录页作为多页面 reference pack 的入口，能跳转页面与状态变体",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Shared Token Discipline",
          "text": "high-fidelity pages 必须受共享 token 驱动，不允许 page-level 失控硬编码绕过视觉系统",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005A",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "UI Style Analysis Artifact",
          "text": "`prototype plan/create` 必须产出 `ui-style-analysis.json/.md`，显式说明视觉系统、目录页 contract 与二开 extension rules",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Guideline Audit Artifact",
          "text": "`prototype review` 或 `review design` 必须产出 `web-guideline-review.json`，记录规则版本、finding、severity、file refs",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006A",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Design Security Review Surface",
          "text": "`review design` 必须可产出 cso-inspired 的 design-security finding，至少覆盖 privileged actions、upload constraints、secret handling、integration boundary、auditability",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Web Guideline Gate",
          "text": "正式 gate 必须可消费 icon button label、skip link、focus-visible、reduced-motion、form labeling、URL state、semantic heading、image dimensions 等关键规则",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-008",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Visual Review Outcome",
          "text": "Beacon 必须能输出 `design_review_outcome`，至少区分 `pass / revise / blocked`",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-009",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Iteration Writeback",
          "text": "design findings 必须回写 next iteration input，至少覆盖 page additions、state additions、design-brief edits、guideline fixes",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-010",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Keep / Discard Governance",
          "text": "每轮 design/prototype policy 迭代必须写入 keep/discard ledger，不满足 benchmark 或 gate 的变更必须 discard",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-011",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Consumer Compatibility",
          "text": "implementation / qa / gate / freeze 均可消费 design brief、design-system contract、guideline audit artifacts",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-011A",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "Design Mode References",
          "text": "design brief / design-system contract 必须可声明 GemDesign/Figma 风格的工作方式参考，但语义必须明确为 Beacon 内部生成模式",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-v112-release",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-01T22:06:59.754200+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1"
